# Antariksh ralph loops — build (DeepSeek) + review (Claude).
# SCAFFOLD — staged for Board review. NOT active until copied to /etc/cron.d/.
# Install:  sudo cp /home/trading_ceo/antariksh/cron/antariksh-ralph.cron /etc/cron.d/antariksh-ralph
# Disable:  sudo rm /etc/cron.d/antariksh-ralph
#
# Enabling runs DeepSeek unattended (incl. market hours, per DAMBUILDER §0e ruling 3).
# Token brakes live in the wrappers: build cap 8/day + flock + 1800s timeout;
# review cap 12/day + flock + 1500s timeout. Both no-op when there's nothing to do.

SHELL=/bin/bash
PATH=/usr/local/bin:/usr/bin:/bin

# OFF-HOURS ONLY — maintenance runs while BOTH markets are closed (equity 09:00–15:31,
# MCX 08:55–23:35). Window = overnight 00:00–07:40 IST. The wrappers ALSO hard-guard on
# check_market_hours.sh (fail-closed), so a misfire can't run during a live session.
#
# Build loop — one ds:ready issue per run, every 20 min, 00:00–07:40 IST (fires :00 :20 :40).
*/20 0-7 * * * root /home/trading_ceo/antariksh/cron/ds_ralph_loop.sh

# Review loop — STAGGERED to :15 and :45 (between build ticks), 00:15–07:45 IST, trails build.
15,45 0-7 * * * root /home/trading_ceo/antariksh/cron/claude_review_loop.sh
